    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Alterchase</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race your way to the finish!</strong> Alterchase is a fast paced parkour game with the essential parkour mechanics like <strong>wall running</strong>, <strong>wall bouncing</strong>, <strong>sliding</strong> and <strong>double jumping</strong>! Alterchase also includes a campaign, and don't forget the\u00a0<strong>laser pistols</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Early access includes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 campaign levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The greatness of knowing that you are part of the Foxnova Beta Program</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Have fun!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>-Foxnova</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777320/extras/5c8fe1802c10b7bedae28b53d061725c.avif?t=1752884186\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p>",
